   "ro": "Ai grijă!"
  },
  {
   "key": "1922654328856256516",
   "en": "And?",
   "ro": "Și?"
  },
  {
   "key": "1922654328923365380",
   "en": "All of a sudden…? How come…? Yeah, he was looking… 10 years ago!",
   "ro": "Deodată…? Cum adică…? Da, se uita… acum 10 ani!"
  },
  {
   "key": "1922654328940142596",
